1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,834
Looking for work in this heat has me sweating buckets.

2
00:00:03,134 --> 00:00:07,184
Pappu, turn this heat into business! Start a sugarcane juice stall!

3
00:00:07,484 --> 00:00:09,526
The machine must be really expensive, Chacha?

4
00:00:09,826 --> 00:00:14,615
A motorised machine and a cart, about ₹70,000 in all.

5
00:00:14,915 --> 00:00:20,848
Keep the machine clean, use clean ice, add lemon and ginger. People come back for the taste.

6
00:00:21,398 --> 00:00:24,952
Bhaiya, one large glass with ice! My throat is dry!

7
00:00:25,252 --> 00:00:28,026
Ice-cold sugarcane juice. ₹30 a glass!

8
00:00:28,326 --> 00:00:36,169
The cane in a glass costs just ₹6 or ₹7. In summer you can keep up to ₹3,000 a day.

9
00:00:36,469 --> 00:00:41,561
But it is seasonal. In winter, turn the same cart into soup or roasted corn.

10
00:00:41,861 --> 00:00:44,244
Summer came and brought money! Pappu's life is set!
